WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.139 --> 00:00:06.480
Hi everyone, welcome to Introduction to Networking in Unreal Engine 5 for Programmers.

2
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.199
In this talk, we're going to cover the following. We're going to look at the server-client

3
00:00:10.199 --> 00:00:14.439
model and any gameplay frameworks associated with them. We're going to look at variable

4
00:00:14.439 --> 00:00:19.039
replication and remote procedure calls or RPCs. Then we're going to look at relevancy

5
00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:23.600
and dormancy, followed by the net role and net mode. After that we're going to look

6
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:28.140
at the active replication flow and then the replication graph. Finally, we're going

7
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.199
to look at travelling in multiplayer and then testing in multiplayer.
